   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">OSG203 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Operating System — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12944 · Decision 857/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 05/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">OSG203 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Operating System — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12944 · QĐ 857/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 05/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">OSG203</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Operating System_Hệ điều hành</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\"><em>not published by the university</em></span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism,In-class lecture,Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12944</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">857/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/05/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/5/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">OSG203</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Operating System_Hệ điều hành</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45h contact hours + 1h final exam + 104h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\"><em>trường không công bố</em></span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Social Constructivism,In-class lecture,Inquiry-based Teaching</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12944</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">857/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/05/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/5/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>At the end of this course, students will be able to:<br>1.Background Knowledge: (ABET e)<br>- Understand the role and functions of an operating system.<br>- Grasp important OS concepts such as kernels, file systems, and process management.<br>- Comprehend the mechanisms of operating systems, including memory hierarchy and CPU roles.<br>- Identify and analyze main problems and challenges in operating systems.<br>2.Practical Skills: (ABET k)<br>- Use basic and advanced shell commands in a Linux system fluently.<br>- Develop proficiency in shell scripting on Linux.<br>- Address and solve key operating system problems through practical exercises and simulations.<br>3.Information Searching, Reading, and Selection Skills: (ABET i)<br>- Efficiently search for, read, and select relevant information related to operating systems and Linux.<br>4.Teamwork, Documentation, and Presentation Skills: (ABET g)<br>- Work effectively in groups to complete projects.<br>- Document and present findings and solutions clearly and professionally.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>At the end of this course, students will be able to:<br>1.Background Knowledge: (ABET e)<br>- Understand the role and functions of an operating system.<br>- Grasp important OS concepts such as kernels, file systems, and process management.<br>- Comprehend the mechanisms of operating systems, including memory hierarchy and CPU roles.<br>- Identify and analyze main problems and challenges in operating systems.<br>2.Practical Skills: (ABET k)<br>- Use basic and advanced shell commands in a Linux system fluently.<br>- Develop proficiency in shell scripting on Linux.<br>- Address and solve key operating system problems through practical exercises and simulations.<br>3.Information Searching, Reading, and Selection Skills: (ABET i)<br>- Efficiently search for, read, and select relevant information related to operating systems and Linux.<br>4.Teamwork, Documentation, and Presentation Skills: (ABET g)<br>- Work effectively in groups to complete projects.<br>- Document and present findings and solutions clearly and professionally.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
