   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">OSG203 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12944 · Decision 857/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 05/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">OSG203 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12944 · QĐ 857/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 05/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Lab</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>4</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>in lab session</td><td>CLO1 - CLO9</td><td>Practical exercises</td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Progress test</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>30' - 60'</td><td>CLO1 - CLO8</td><td>Multiple choices marked by computer or a suitable format</td><td>10 - 60 (At least 10*n questions, where n is the number of chapters covered in the test.)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Project</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>~30'/group</td><td>CLO1 - CLO9</td><td>N/A</td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>TE</strong></td><td>Final exam</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60'</td><td></td><td>Multiple choices marked by computer or a suitable format</td><td>50</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lab</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Technical aspects of studied topics.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Guided by instructor<br><em>Note:</em> The lab report content can be obtained from the lab manual, the lab templates, or created by the instructor to align with the chapters.</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Current chapter(s).<br>Each progress test covers at least 01 chapter and at most 06 chapter, and overall they must cover all learned chapters of the course.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> In class/remote, by instructor<br><em>Note:</em> Instructions and schedules for progress tests must be included in the course implementation plan, which requires approval from the campus director.<br>Progress tests should be administered immediately following the last lectures covering the required material.<br>Instructors are responsible for reviewing the graded tests with students.</li>\n<li><strong>Project</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Students can either choose a topic themselves or refer to a list of topics suggested by lecturers.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Prepare at home, work in groups, and present during class hours<br><em>Note:</em> 25 minutes/group (maximum) + 5 minutes Q&amp;A</li>\n<li><strong>TE</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Concepts, algorithms, operations;<br>All chapters from 1 to 12; more than 70% new questions (for the current semester);<br><em>Grading guide:</em> By exam board</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lab</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Technical aspects of studied topics.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Guided by instructor<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> The lab report content can be obtained from the lab manual, the lab templates, or created by the instructor to align with the chapters.</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Current chapter(s).<br>Each progress test covers at least 01 chapter and at most 06 chapter, and overall they must cover all learned chapters of the course.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> In class/remote, by instructor<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> Instructions and schedules for progress tests must be included in the course implementation plan, which requires approval from the campus director.<br>Progress tests should be administered immediately following the last lectures covering the required material.<br>Instructors are responsible for reviewing the graded tests with students.</li>\n<li><strong>Project</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Students can either choose a topic themselves or refer to a list of topics suggested by lecturers.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Prepare at home, work in groups, and present during class hours<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> 25 minutes/group (maximum) + 5 minutes Q&amp;A</li>\n<li><strong>TE</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Concepts, algorithms, operations;<br>All chapters from 1 to 12; more than 70% new questions (for the current semester);<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> By exam board</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12944</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
